{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>FairyScanner 是一款把相片或頁面文字快速轉為可編輯內容的 OCR 掃描與閱讀工具，適合需要整理文件、校對文字或透過 AI 語音朗讀的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-221.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>相片文字即時辨識</h2>\n<p>FairyScanner 主打即時相片文字辨識，能將頁面或圖片中的大段文字轉到手機編輯，並以 AI 語音輔助閱讀。它支援準確辨識、可編輯內容與簡易校對，亦可把文字轉成語音，並提供多種語言及發音。操作簡單，一分鐘內即可上手，而且沒有內嵌廣告，使用時更舒適。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-15.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-16.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-17.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-18.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-19.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：FairyScanner-OCR Scan &amp; Reader</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fairyscanner-ocr-scan-reader/id1435857951?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:43:50.960153+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:31:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:37:36.713491+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:37:26.705231+00:00","content_hash":"de3cb4f3e1b09c286e5fa99a92f168f29b12a45a70a7a6e871839c2e5375ad8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}